                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ebfe157f-6f43-3d37-89ff-8a0cb4e3f43e",
                        "entry_id": "62ebfab5-6a5d-3749-96fe-97e501a7d270",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To withdraw the status of legal tender from a coin (etc.) and remove it from circulation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "758ca075-30a2-4499-bc9e-d73651d95e3f",
                                "sense_id": "ebfe157f-6f43-3d37-89ff-8a0cb4e3f43e",
                                "text": "A bill to demonetize existing French gold coinage has been introduced in the Chamber of Deputies by Deputies Lenoir, Bouffandeau, and Eymond. The purpose is to force hoarders to bring out gold estimated at 4,000,000,000 francs which is still kept in hiding in spite of patriotic appeals to the owners to exchange it for notes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be336397-3c52-3594-943e-0397450e31db",
                        "entry_id": "62ebfab5-6a5d-3749-96fe-97e501a7d270",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To declare ineligible or worthless as a medium of exchange or as legal tender."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2be4628e-a1a1-4853-81d3-5177b8a82e68",
                                "sense_id": "be336397-3c52-3594-943e-0397450e31db",
                                "text": "1943 Post Office Department, U.S., A Description of United States Postage Stamps Issued by the Post Office Department from July 1, 1847, to April 1, 1945 [sic]. Washington: United States Government Printing Office; p4: Stamps of 1847 and 1851 Demonetized\nThese stamps are obsolete and worthless for postage. A reasonable time after hostilities began in 1861 was given for the exchange of stamps in the hands of the public and for the replacement of post office stocks. Their acceptance in the prepayment of postage was ordered discontinued in the several States and Territories, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8ed3efb4-3293-374c-90c7-2a7969b7fa7e",
                        "entry_id": "62ebfab5-6a5d-3749-96fe-97e501a7d270",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To demote (published content, or its creator) so that it is no longer eligible to earn money for its publisher."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42d86605-9b91-45bb-a0dd-7c74d200089e",
                                "sense_id": "8ed3efb4-3293-374c-90c7-2a7969b7fa7e",
                                "text": "The site has the ability to demonetize a video."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72205bf3-701d-4e99-80cb-3db33d28fbe7",
                                "sense_id": "8ed3efb4-3293-374c-90c7-2a7969b7fa7e",
                                "text": "Other high-profile YouTube stars including Logan Paul, Shane Dawson and David Dobrik have had their channels demonetized after controversies in the media. Many demonetized creators still run highly profitable businesses."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1524890a-b161-4437-8df4-ec466515ed42",
                        "source_entry_id": "62ebfab5-6a5d-3749-96fe-97e501a7d270",
                        "source_sense_description": "internet: to demote so that it is no longer eligible to earn money",
                        "target_lang_word": "démonétiser",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "démonétiser",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecefcd87-33a4-3c96-8274-37a87e254a33",
                                        "entry_id": "76495761-5511-3a35-b967-6255b8eb55a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Déprécier une monnaie, un papier-monnaie, en lui ôtant la valeur que la loi lui avait attribuée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08bad2bc-c160-40a8-bdd0-6137b9aaba26",
                                                "sense_id": "ecefcd87-33a4-3c96-8274-37a87e254a33",
                                                "text": "Démonétiser des pièces d’argent à l'effigie de Céres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c15489a4-5083-4c29-903b-070204f44d57",
                                                "sense_id": "ecefcd87-33a4-3c96-8274-37a87e254a33",
                                                "text": "Le film s’inspire de la décision historique prise par le gouvernement indien en novembre 2016 de démonétiser les grosses coupures de 500 et 1 000 rupee afin de tuer le marché de fausse monnaie qui finançait les activités illégales et le terrorisme dans le pays."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d922e298-9e0f-31d1-bcaf-e80037bfdce8",
                                        "entry_id": "76495761-5511-3a35-b967-6255b8eb55a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Faire perdre tout crédit, toute influence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb6ce51d-cc22-4da9-940c-12ec3d0ab06a",
                                                "sense_id": "d922e298-9e0f-31d1-bcaf-e80037bfdce8",
                                                "text": "Cette doctrine a déconsidéré les princes d'Orléans. La monarchie constitutionnelle semble, depuis eux, démonétisée en France."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fee13142-5d9c-4898-ac31-6acd26e544fa",
                                                "sense_id": "d922e298-9e0f-31d1-bcaf-e80037bfdce8",
                                                "text": "L’effet immédiat est en général de démonétiser l’information contrôlée et de nourrir la fibre complotiste : « On nous dit rien, on nous cache tout. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2eafa322-4d1a-4de8-ae5c-419698a37c58",
                                                "sense_id": "d922e298-9e0f-31d1-bcaf-e80037bfdce8",
                                                "text": "\"Le gouvernement a tout fait pour démonétiser sa propre parole\", il a \"tout fait pour créer le doute et la confusion dans l'esprit de nos compatriotes\", a accusé M. Milon, estimant qu'\"il ne doit pas s'étonner de la défiance\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5174f4ac-81b6-4188-b685-ca251fc2c968",
                                                "sense_id": "d922e298-9e0f-31d1-bcaf-e80037bfdce8",
                                                "text": "« Cela démonétise l’accusation portée contre Zemmour et les groupuscules néonazis qui le soutiennent et étaient au meeting. Si les antifascistes sont “fascistes”, plus personne ne l’est, le mot n’a plus aucun sens », poursuit-elle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
